ALL YOU BASE is an interactive media art platform, usable as a mobile tactical tool for spontaneous reactive and interactive audio-visual art in public spaces and urban places.

Packed with lots of lovely lumens, 3D sensor, mobile internet, streaming infrastructure, web remote connectivity, a powerful computer, wireless LED spots ...

BEST FEATURE THOUGH: 
WE ARE ABLE TO LEND ALL YOUR BASE TO YOU for your upcoming projects and interventions on the urban world! 

